            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Actually wait, this can simply be fixed by:\n```diff\ndiff --git a/src/nvim/window.c b/src/nvim/window.c\nindex 531c594633..824df4fbed 100644\n--- a/src/nvim/window.c\n+++ b/src/nvim/window.c\n@@ -6852,12 +6852,15 @@ static void win_fix_cursor(bool normal)\n {\n   win_T *wp = curwin;\n \n-  if (!wp->w_do_win_fix_cursor\n-      || wp->w_buffer->b_ml.ml_line_count < wp->w_view_height) {\n+  if (!wp->w_do_win_fix_cursor) {\n     return;\n   }\n-\n   wp->w_do_win_fix_cursor = false;\n+\n+  if (wp->w_buffer->b_ml.ml_line_count < wp->w_view_height) {\n+    return;\n+  }\n+\n   // Determine valid cursor range.\n   int so = (int)MIN(wp->w_view_height / 2, get_scrolloff_value(wp));\n   linenr_T lnum = wp->w_cursor.lnum;\n```",
